    "title": "ESQC mathematics exercises",
    "section": "",
    "text": "Preface\nThis is a stripped-down copy of the Physical Chemistry Quarto book, ready to use as the starting point for a new book or course compendium. The fonts, callouts, light and dark themes, and output settings are already in place.\nReplace this page with your own preface or course description. The title, author, cover, and chapter list live in _quarto.yml.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nLearning-goalsLearning Goals\n\n\n\n\nFind the main layout and typography settings.\nRender the book as HTML and EPUB.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPreparationsPreparations\n\n\n\nInstall Quarto 1.9.38 or newer. The extensions and fonts are included in this folder.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFactA representative equation\n\n\n\nFor a harmonic oscillator, the vibrational energies are\n\\[\nE_\\nu=\\hbar\\omega\\left(\\nu+\\frac{1}{2}\\right),\n\\qquad\n\\omega=\\sqrt{\\frac{k}{\\mu}}.\n\\]\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVisualizationVisualization app\n\n\n\nUse this callout for a visualization, dataset, notebook, or another resource that students can explore alongside the text.",
